icionales aunque el transporte permita técnicamente una conexión."},"3199":{"id":"/docs/red/v1/steam/protocolo","page_id":"/docs/red/v1/steam/protocolo","type":"page","content":"Protocolo","breadcrumbs":["Docs","Red","Red","Contenido","Steam"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/red/v1/steam/protocolo"},"3200":{"id":"/docs/red/v1/steam/protocolo-0","page_id":"/docs/red/v1/steam/protocolo","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/red/v1/steam/protocolo","content":"Qué parte del protocolo pertenece a Eco y qué parte a Steam."},"3201":{"id":"/docs/red/v1/steam/protocolo-1","page_id":"/docs/red/v1/steam/protocolo","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/red/v1/steam/protocolo#ventaja","content":"Ventaja"},"3202":{"id":"/docs/red/v1/steam/protocolo-2","page_id":"/docs/red/v1/steam/protocolo","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/red/v1/steam/protocolo#limitación-conceptual","content":"Limitación conceptual"},"3203":{"id":"/docs/red/v1/steam/protocolo-3","page_id":"/docs/red/v1/steam/protocolo","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/red/v1/steam/protocolo","content":"La integración Steam no reemplaza el protocolo de Eco. Implementa un transporte que satisface `IConnection`."},"3204":{"id":"/docs/red/v1/steam/protocolo-4","page_id":"/docs/red/v1/steam/protocolo","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/red/v1/steam/protocolo","content":"La clase `P2PConnection` recibe un `Buffer`, extrae paquetes completos y los envía al Steam ID remoto. Al desconectarse, genera el estado de desconexión que Eco puede procesar. fileciteturn190file0"},"3205":{"id":"/docs/red/v1/steam/protocolo-5","page_id":"/docs/red/v1/steam/protocolo","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/red/v1/steam/protocolo#ventaja","content":"El código de gameplay no necesita conocer si un paquete viaja por TCP, UDP o Steam P2P. La capa de transporte mantiene esa decisión aislada."},"3206":{"id":"/docs/red/v1/steam/protocolo-6","page_id":"/docs/red/v1/steam/protocolo","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/red/v1/steam/protocolo#limitación-conceptual","content":"Cambiar el transporte no elimina los problemas de diseño del protocolo. Tamaño de paquetes, frecuencia, serialización, ownership, destinatarios y autoridad siguen siendo responsabilidad de la arquitectura Eco."},"3207":{"id":"/docs/red/v1/steam/protocolo-7","page_id":"/docs/red/v1/steam/protocolo","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/red/v1/steam/protocolo#limitación-conceptual","content":"Steam proporciona el camino. Eco define qué se transmite y el juego define qué significa."},"3208":{"id":"/docs/red/v1/steam/rich-presence","page_id":"/docs/red/v1/steam/rich-presence","type":"page","content":"Rich Presence","breadcrumbs":["Docs","Red","Red","Contenido","Steam"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/red/v1/steam/rich-presence"},"3209":{"id":"/docs/red/v1/steam/rich-presence-0","page_id":"/docs/red/v1/steam/rich-presence","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/red/v1/steam/rich-presence","content":"Utilizar la presencia de Steam para anunciar el estado de conexión."},"3210":{"id":"/docs/red/v1/steam/rich-presence-1","page_id":"/docs/red/v1/steam/rich-presence","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/red/v1/steam/rich-presence#estado","content":"Estado"},"3211":{"id":"/docs/red/v1/steam/rich-presence-2","page_id":"/docs/red/v1/steam/rich-presence","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/red/v1/steam/rich-presence#amigos-con-partida","content":"Amigos con partida"},"3212":{"id":"/docs/red/v1/steam/rich-presence-3","page_id":"/docs/red/v1/steam/rich-presence","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/red/v1/steam/rich-presence#seguridad","content":"Seguridad"},"3213":{"id":"/docs/red/v1/steam/rich-presence-4","page_id":"/docs/red/v1/steam/rich-presence","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/red/v1/steam/rich-presence","content":"La integración de Eco utiliza la clave `connect` de Steam Rich Presence como puente para la función de unirse a una partida."},"3214":{"id":"/docs/red/v1/steam/rich-presence-5","page_id":"/docs/red/v1/steam/rich-presence","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/red/v1/steam/rich-presence","content":"No debe confundirse Rich Presence con un sistema de lobby de Eco. Es una capa de descubrimiento y experiencia de usuario."},"3215":{"id":"/docs/red/v1/steam/rich-presence-6","page_id":"/docs/red/v1/steam/rich-presence","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/red/v1/steam/rich-presence#estado","content":"`Steam.PermitirUnirseAmigos` actualiza ese valor según el estado de la conexión. fileciteturn190file0"},"3216":{"id":"/docs/red/v1/steam/rich-presence-7","page_id":"/docs/red/v1/steam/rich-presence","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/red/v1/steam/rich-presence#amigos-con-partida","content":"La integración dispone de `ObtenerAmigosConPartida()`, que recorre los amigos inmediatos y busca el campo `connect` para identificar aquellos que anuncian una partida. fileciteturn190file0"},"3217":{"id":"/docs/red/v1/steam/rich-presence-8","page_id":"/docs/red/v1/steam/rich-presence","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/red/v1/steam/rich-presence#amigos-con-partida","content":"Esto permite construir una UI propia de \"amigos jugando\" sin hacer que Steam determine la estructura del lobby Eco."},"3218":{"id":"/docs/red/v1/steam/rich-presence-9","page_id":"/docs/red/v1/steam/rich-presence","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/red/v1/steam/rich-presence#seguridad","content":"El valor `connect` debe tratarse como una pista de descubrimiento. La entrada real debe validarse en Eco."},"3219":{"id":"/docs/red/v1/steam/unirse-a-amigos","page_id":"/docs/red/v1/steam/unirse-a-amigos","type":"page","content":"Unirse a amigos","breadcrumbs":["Docs","Red","Red","Contenido","Steam"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/red/v1/steam/unirse-a-amigos"},"3220":{"id":"/docs/red/v1/steam/unirse-a-amigos-0","page_id":"/docs/red/v1/steam/unirse-a-amigos","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/red/v1/steam/unirse-a-amigos","content":"Permitir que un amigo de Steam entre directamente en una partida."},"3221":{"id":"/docs/red/v1/steam/unirse-a-amigos-1","pa