e comprobar `canUseUDP` y conocer el puerto de escucha mediante `listeningPort`."},"3582":{"id":"/docs/red/v1/transporte/tcp-udp-17","page_id":"/docs/red/v1/transporte/tcp-udp","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/red/v1/transporte/tcp-udp#activación","content":"UDP no se considera disponible simplemente porque exista una instancia del protocolo. El servidor debe proporcionar un puerto UDP y el cliente debe completar su activación."},"3583":{"id":"/docs/red/v1/transporte/tcp-udp-18","page_id":"/docs/red/v1/transporte/tcp-udp","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/red/v1/transporte/tcp-udp#qué-transporte-elegir","content":"La elección depende de la semántica del mensaje:"},"3584":{"id":"/docs/red/v1/transporte/tcp-udp-19","page_id":"/docs/red/v1/transporte/tcp-udp","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/red/v1/transporte/tcp-udp#qué-transporte-elegir","content":"Característica"},"3585":{"id":"/docs/red/v1/transporte/tcp-udp-20","page_id":"/docs/red/v1/transporte/tcp-udp","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/red/v1/transporte/tcp-udp#qué-transporte-elegir","content":"TCP"},"3586":{"id":"/docs/red/v1/transporte/tcp-udp-21","page_id":"/docs/red/v1/transporte/tcp-udp","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/red/v1/transporte/tcp-udp#qué-transporte-elegir","content":"UDP"},"3587":{"id":"/docs/red/v1/transporte/tcp-udp-22","page_id":"/docs/red/v1/transporte/tcp-udp","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/red/v1/transporte/tcp-udp#qué-transporte-elegir","content":"Entrega fiable"},"3588":{"id":"/docs/red/v1/transporte/tcp-udp-23","page_id":"/docs/red/v1/transporte/tcp-udp","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/red/v1/transporte/tcp-udp#qué-transporte-elegir","content":"Sí"},"3589":{"id":"/docs/red/v1/transporte/tcp-udp-24","page_id":"/docs/red/v1/transporte/tcp-udp","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/red/v1/transporte/tcp-udp#qué-transporte-elegir","content":"No"},"3590":{"id":"/docs/red/v1/transporte/tcp-udp-25","page_id":"/docs/red/v1/transporte/tcp-udp","tags":[],"type":"text",